{"seq":6,"slug":"lc0152-maximum-product-subarray","title":"LeetCode 152 乘积最大子数组","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/leetcode-practice/medium-dp/lc0152-maximum-product-subarray","wordCount":895,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"leetcode-152-乘积最大子数组\">LeetCode 152 乘积最大子数组</h1><h2 id=\"题目描述\">题目描述</h2><p>给你一个整数数组 <code>nums</code>，请你找出数组中乘积最大的非空连续子数组（该子数组中至少包含一个数字），并返回该子数组所对应的乘积。</p>\n<p>测试用例的答案是一个 32 位整数。</p>\n<p><strong>约束条件：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>1 ≤ nums.length ≤ 2 × 10⁴</li>\n<li>-10 ≤ nums[i] ≤ 10</li>\n<li>nums 的任何前缀或后缀的乘积都保证是一个 32 位整数</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>示例 1：</strong></p>\n<p>输入：nums = [2,3,-2,4] 输出：6解释：子数组 [2,3] 有最大乘积 6。</p>\n<p><strong>示例 2：</strong></p>\n<p>输入：nums = [-2,0,-1] 输出：0 解释：结果不能为 2，因为 [-2,-1] 不是子数组（不连续）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"解题思路\">解题思路</h2><p>本题与 LC #53（最大子数组和）类似，但乘法的特殊性使问题更加复杂：<strong>负数乘以负数会变成正数</strong>。这意味着当前的最小值（一个很大的负数）在遇到负数后可能变成最大值。</p>\n<p>因此不能像最大子数组和那样只维护一个状态，而需要同时维护<strong>当前位置结尾的最大乘积</strong>和<strong>最小乘积</strong>。</p>\n<p><strong>状态定义</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>maxProduct[i]</code>：以 <code>nums[i]</code> 结尾的子数组的最大乘积</li>\n<li><code>minProduct[i]</code>：以 <code>nums[i]</code> 结尾的子数组的最小乘积</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>状态转移方程</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>maxProduct[i] = max(nums[i], maxProduct[i-1] × nums[i], minProduct[i-1] × nums[i])</code></li>\n<li><code>minProduct[i] = min(nums[i], maxProduct[i-1] × nums[i], minProduct[i-1] × nums[i])</code></li>\n</ul>\n<p>三个候选值分别对应：只取当前元素（重新开始）、延续之前的最大乘积、延续之前的最小乘积（负负得正）。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>时间复杂度</th>\n<th>空间复杂度</th>\n<th>核心思想</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>暴力枚举</td>\n<td>O(n²)</td>\n<td>O(1)</td>\n<td>枚举所有子数组</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>双状态 DP</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n<td>O(1)</td>\n<td>同时追踪最大和最小乘积</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"代码实现\">代码实现</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"function maxProduct(nums: number[]): number {&#10;  let currMax = nums[0];&#10;  let currMin = nums[0];&#10;  let result = nums[0];&#10;&#10;  for (let i = 1; i &lt; nums.length; i++) {&#10;    const candidates = [nums[i], currMax * nums[i], currMin * nums[i]];&#10;    currMax = Math.max(...candidates);&#10;    currMin = Math.min(...candidates);&#10;    result = Math.max(result, currMax);&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  return result;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> maxProduct</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">nums</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[])</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> currMax </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nums[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> currMin </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nums[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> result </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nums[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nums.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">length</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; i</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">++</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> candidates</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [nums[i], currMax </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nums[i], currMin </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nums[i]];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    currMax </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Math.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">max</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">...</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">candidates);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    currMin </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Math.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">min</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">...</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">candidates);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    result </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Math.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">max</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(result, currMax);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> result;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>代码逻辑详解：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>currMax</code>：以当前位置结尾的最大乘积</li>\n<li><code>currMin</code>：以当前位置结尾的最小乘积</li>\n<li><code>result</code>：全局最大乘积</li>\n</ul>\n<p>每到一个新位置，有三种选择：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><code>nums[i]</code>：从当前位置重新开始一个新的子数组</li>\n<li><code>currMax * nums[i]</code>：将当前元素接到之前最大乘积子数组的后面</li>\n<li><code>currMin * nums[i]</code>：将当前元素接到之前最小乘积子数组的后面</li>\n</ol>\n<p>取三者的最大值作为新的 <code>currMax</code>，最小值作为新的 <code>currMin</code>。</p>\n<p><strong>为什么需要同时维护最小值？</strong></p>\n<p>考虑 <code>nums = [-2, 3, -4]</code>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>i=0: currMax=-2, currMin=-2</li>\n<li>i=1: candidates=[3, -6, -6], currMax=3, currMin=-6</li>\n<li>i=2: candidates=[-4, -12, 24], currMax=24, currMin=-12</li>\n<li>result=24</li>\n</ul>\n<p>如果只维护最大值，在 i=1 时 currMax=3，到 i=2 时 3×(-4)=-12，错失了 (-6)×(-4)=24 的最优解。这就是&quot;负负得正&quot;带来的特殊性。</p>\n<p><strong>避免展开运算符的优化版本：</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"function maxProductOptimized(nums: number[]): number {&#10;  let currMax = nums[0];&#10;  let currMin = nums[0];&#10;  let result = nums[0];&#10;&#10;  for (let i = 1; i &lt; nums.length; i++) {&#10;    if (nums[i] &lt; 0) {&#10;      [currMax, currMin] = [currMin, currMax];&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    currMax = Math.max(nums[i], currMax * nums[i]);&#10;    currMin = Math.min(nums[i], currMin * nums[i]);&#10;    result = Math.max(result, currMax);&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  return result;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> maxProductOptimized</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">nums</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[])</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> currMax </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nums[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> currMin </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nums[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> result </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nums[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nums.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">length</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; i</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">++</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (nums[i] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      [currMax, currMin] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [currMin, currMax];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    currMax </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Math.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">max</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(nums[i], currMax </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nums[i]);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    currMin </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Math.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">min</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(nums[i], currMin </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nums[i]);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    result </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Math.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">max</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(result, currMax);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> result;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>当 <code>nums[i]</code> 为负数时，先交换 <code>currMax</code> 和 <code>currMin</code>。这样乘以负数后，原来的最大变最小、原来的最小变最大，逻辑更加清晰。</p>\n<p><strong>与 LC #53 最大子数组和的对比：</strong></p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>LC #53 (求和)</th>\n<th>LC #152 (求积)</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>状态数量</td>\n<td>1 个（最大和）</td>\n<td>2 个（最大积 + 最小积）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>原因</td>\n<td>加法不改变符号</td>\n<td>乘法可能翻转符号</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>转移方程</td>\n<td>max(nums[i], dp[i-1] + nums[i])</td>\n<td>需要考虑三种情况</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"复杂度分析\">复杂度分析</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>复杂度</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>时间复杂度</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n<td>单次遍历数组</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>空间复杂度</td>\n<td>O(1)</td>\n<td>仅使用三个变量</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>本题展示了 DP 中一个重要的设计技巧：<strong>当单一状态不足以刻画问题时，需要增加状态维度</strong>。&quot;最大值&quot;和&quot;最小值&quot;配对追踪的模式，在涉及乘法、绝对值等可能改变大小关系的问题中非常常见。LC #628（三个数的最大乘积）也使用了类似的&quot;同时追踪极大和极小&quot;的思路。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"LeetCode 152 乘积最大子数组","id":"leetcode-152-乘积最大子数组"},{"level":2,"text":"题目描述","id":"题目描述"},{"level":2,"text":"解题思路","id":"解题思路"},{"level":2,"text":"代码实现","id":"代码实现"},{"level":2,"text":"复杂度分析","id":"复杂度分析"}],"prev":{"title":"LeetCode 139 单词拆分","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/leetcode-practice/medium-dp/lc0139-word-break"},"next":{"title":"LeetCode 198 打家劫舍","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/leetcode-practice/medium-dp/lc0198-house-robber"}}